WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.084
♪♪

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:02.085
Poppy:
I still can't believe it.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.963
Poppy:
We're going to fall in love with a
new little person again.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:05.964
(Chuckles)

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:13.013
♪♪

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.014
Dr. Scott:
Just breathe.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.015
♪♪

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.266
Man:
I'm gonna count you down from 3.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.726
♪♪

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:18.727
Man:
And on 3.

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:20.354
Man:
And 2.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.355
Man:
And 1.

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:23.357
Dr. Scott:
Breathe.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:28.820
♪♪

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.322
Cameron:
I can't lie to my family anymore.

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:32.824
♪♪

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:35.369
Dr. Scott:
The second you tell your wife
that you are dying,

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:37.037
♪♪

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.331
your opportunity to do this is
gone.

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:47.673
♪♪

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:49.007
Dr. Scott:
You want to go say hi?

00:00:49.007 --> 00:01:07.484
♪♪

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:08.485
So he has everything?

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.655
Even the memories you store
deep in your subconscious.

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:12.990
♪♪

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:16.159
Dr. Scott:
Do this with us and let life go
on for your family.

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:17.160
Dr. Scott:
A clean swap.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:22.332
♪♪

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.750
Oh, what's going on, Cam?  

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.502
♪♪

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.921
I can't figure out what the
right thing is here.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.964
-Hugo: Ah oh.
-Cam: Bee boo.

00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:30.257
(Laughing)

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:31.883
Cam:
I thought I had more time, I
guess.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:37.139
♪♪

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:38.390
Dr. Scott:
You have an opportunity here.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.975
I'm not done. I didn't say he
could...

00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:40.976
You're dying.

00:01:40.976 --> 00:01:45.314
♪♪

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:48.066
Cam:
I feel like I've falling in love
with her for the first time again.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:50.736
♪♪

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:51.737
I don't like this.

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:52.863
You think I like this? 

00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:53.530
♪♪

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:54.489
Being told I'm not me.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:55.741
Because you're not me.

00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:56.616
♪♪

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.327
You are not me!

00:01:58.327 --> 00:02:13.216
♪♪

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:15.218
Poppy:
I love you, Cameron Turner.

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:21.558
♪♪

